@startuml
title Вариант 2 - Обычная отправка (успех)

actor "Сервис банка" as Bank
participant "API" as API
participant "Temporal" as Temporal
participant "Воркер" as Worker
participant "Push Адаптер" as Adapter

Bank -> API: POST /notify (idempKey)
API -> Temporal: StartWorkflow(idempKey)
API --> Bank: 202 Accepted

Temporal -> Worker: Взять задачу
Worker -> Adapter: send_push()
Adapter --> Worker: Успех
Worker -> Temporal: Шаг завершен (ждем колбэк)
@enduml